# ==============================================================================
# AthleteX Frontend Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# Backend API Base URL
# - Local Development: uses http://localhost:8000 by default (when running backend locally)
# - Production (Render Backend): https://ai-sports-platform.onrender.com
# Configure this in Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
VITE_API_URL=https://ai-sports-platform.onrender.com

# Web3Forms Contact Form Access Key (Optional override; fallback key included in code)
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here
